{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The adhesive-lined heat shrink feels like a useful next purchase because it would insulate and seal connections made with my crimp terminals.",
    "The epoxy fits my interest in practical repair supplies such as duct tape and vinyl cement, while offering an option for rigid repairs."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The battery lugs and threaded valve require particular wire sizes or fittings; my smaller-wire connectors and hose clamps don't establish that I need those parts.",
    "Grinding discs, cutting wheels, a feeler gauge and a thermometer don't address a task I currently have, and I haven't indicated ownership of a compatible grinder."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My repair purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any workshop supply, even when it serves a different job.",
    "Items involving wiring or plumbing seem to be treated as interchangeable despite differences in size, connection type and purpose."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "A useful connection to something I already use matters more to me than a broad association with maintenance or tools.",
    "The two heat shrink kits serve a similar immediate need; I'd choose the adhesive-lined option rather than buy both."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my interest in practical repairs, but stretched it into specialized tasks and equipment needs I haven't shown."
}"}
